title: Fileless Payload Stored in Registry
id: e86c40fd-fe21-4a43-8822-4e495ba790de
status: experimental
description: Detects large payload blobs written to the registry.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1027/011/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: registry_set
detection:
  selection:
    Details|re: '^[A-Za-z0-9+/=]{1024,}$'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - TargetObject
  - Image
falsepositives:
  - Applications caching encoded data in the registry
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1027.011
